      "taskDescription": "<b>Samira:</b> Alex, the academy’s sandbox lab is ready and I want you to demonstrate how mapping a network reveals which hosts and services are visible. Open the lab mapping app and run the Zenmap-style scenario that performs a safe reconnaissance sweep; the scenario will produce a scan report listing hosts and visible ports. Collect the scan output and assemble a short observation list noting any services that look unexpectedly exposed. When you have that, tell me what the results suggest about potential exposure and where a defender should focus next.",
